        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN100SBR, 1 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from different wood types ranging from light wood to dark wood. All of the wood types are unfinished so that their natural beauty can shine through. This wooden door handle has brass mounts which can be finished in any of First Impressions' huge selection of colors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-wood-door-pull-with-brass-mounts-first-impressions-lgn150sbr\"><b>1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LGN100SBR Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LGN01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions LGN100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LGN100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN100036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull",
                "description": "The 1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from different wood types ranging from light wood to dark wood. All of the wood types are unfinished so that their natural beauty can shine through. This wooden door handle has brass mounts which can be finished in any of First Impressions' huge selection of colors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Wooden 1 Inch Laguna Door Pulls, 1 Inch Diameter Laguna Door Pull with Brass Mounts, First Impressions LGN01, FII-LGN01, wood door pulls, wood door handles, wood store front door handles, Laguna collection series 1 pulls, 1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Mounts, First Impressions LGN01 Laguna Wood Door Handles, First Impressions LGN100SBR, FII-LGN100SBR,"
